# Header Components (`src/components/Headers/`)

- **`ScreenHeader`**: Primary header; supports back nav, custom left/right, titles, subtitles. Pass `scrollPositionSharedValue` for large-title collapse on scroll.
- **`ModalHeader`**: Modal variant; forces `renderLeft={null}`, standard close button on right. Props: `onClosePress`, `hideClose`, `disableClose`.
- **`SearchHeader`**: Search trigger header for home search navigation.
- **`EXTRA_TOUCH_AREA`**: Always use for `hitSlop` on header buttons (from `Headers.constants.ts`).
